     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem regimen-modification-kind</b></p><a name=\"regimen-modification-kind\"> </a><a name=\"hcregimen-modification-kind\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://hemonc.org/fhir/CodeSystem/regimen-modification-kind</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">omit-action<a name=\"regimen-modification-kind-omit-action\"> </a></td><td>Omit action</td><td>An action present in the parent is removed (e.g. the fluorouracil bolus).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">add-action<a name=\"regimen-modification-kind-add-action\"> </a></td><td>Add action</td><td>An action absent in the parent is added (e.g. a supportive-care medication).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">replace-dose<a name=\"regimen-modification-kind-replace-dose\"> </a></td><td>Replace dose</td><td>Same drug, same schedule, different dose or dose basis (e.g. mg/m² → flat mg).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">replace-schedule<a name=\"regimen-modification-kind-replace-schedule\"> </a></td><td>Replace schedule</td><td>Same drug and dose, different days, frequency or infusion duration.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">replace-route<a name=\"regimen-modification-kind-replace-route\"> </a></td><td>Replace route</td><td>Same drug and dose, different route.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">replace-product<a name=\"regimen-modification-kind-replace-product\"> </a></td><td>Replace product</td><td>Different product for the same component (e.g. leucovorin → levoleucovorin).</td></tr></table></div>"
